    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "Executable Pending single-Spark OpenAI-compatible text-and-image recipe for Meta Muse Glimmer 30B NVFP4 (RedHatAI W4A4) with the official Meta DFlash drafter, FP8 KV cache and the muse_glimmer reasoning/tool parsers, following the MiaAI-Lab DGX Spark launch profile on the official vLLM 0.30.0 ARM64 image. Context defaults to the model's native 131072 (upstream's 262144 needs an unmerged RoPE-cache patch on a vLLM fork). Chat, vision, reasoning, tool calling and DFlash speedup remain Candidate capabilities; upstream throughput figures are its own claims.",
